    "explanation": "🔖Here, a - b = 4<br/>or, a = b + 4------(i)<br/>Again, ab = 21<br/>or, (b + 4)b = 21 [from (i)]<br/>or, b2 + 4b - 21 = 0<br/>or. b2 + 7b - 3b - 21 = 0<br/>or, b(b+7) - 3(b +7) = 0<br/>or, (b + 7) (b - 3) =0<br/>or, b - 3 = 0 [b ≠ -7]<br/>So, b = 3.<br/>Now, a + b + c = 6 x 3<br/>or, a + b + c = 18<br/>or, b + 4 + b + c = 18 [from(i)]<br/>or, 3 + 4 + 3 + c = 18<br/>or, c = 18 - 10 = 8",
