    "id": "miq_368",
    "question": "A worker was hired for 7 days. Each day, he was paid Tk. 10 more than what he was paid for the previous day of work. The total amount he was paid in the first 4 days of work equaled the total amount he was paid in the last 3 days. What was his starting pay?",
    "options": [
      "Tk. 90",
      "Tk. 138",
      "Tk. 153",
      "Tk. 160"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "Tk. 90",
    "explanation": "📝Question: A worker was hired for 7 days. Each day, he was paid Tk. 10 more than what he was paid for the previous day of work. the total amount he was paid in the first 4 days of work equaled the total amount he was paid in the last 3 days. What was his staring pay?<br/>❐ Solution:<br/>ধরি, <br/>starting payment ছিলো x টাকা<br/>❐ ২য় দিন = x + 10<br/>৩য় দিন = ( x + 20)<br/>৪র্থ দিন = ( x + 30)<br/>৫ম দিন = ( x + 40)<br/>৬ষ্ঠ দিন = ( x + 50)<br/>৭ম দিন = ( x + 60) টাকা<br/>❐ প্রশ্নমতে,<br/>x + (x + 10) + (x + 20) + (x + 30) = (x + 40) + (x + 50) + (x + 60)<br/>4x + 60 = 3x + 150<br/>4x - 3x = 150 - 60<br/>x = 90",
